{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/tokenExchange(subjectToken:subjectTokenType:actorToken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantID:configuration:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["Linux"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"tokenExchange"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subjectToken"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sensitive"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subjectTokenType"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"actorToken"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/Sensitive","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sensitive"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":">? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"scopes"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"audience"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"resource"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tenantID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"configuration"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcConfiguration","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK17OidcConfigurationV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"OidcConfiguration"},{"kind":"text","text":"? = nil) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"async"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ExchangedToken","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK14ExchangedTokenV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"ExchangedToken"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"the token being exchanged — positional and first, because four"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"optional strings in positional order is a bug waiting to be written."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"subjectToken"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"what kind of token "},{"code":"subjectToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" is. "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Required"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (§15.1), with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no default: a default would be this SDK choosing which kind of credential the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"caller holds, which is what §15.7 forbids. Pass "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/accessTokenType","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" for the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"same-domain exchange, or "},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/jwtTokenType","type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" for a trusted external issuer’s JWT"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(§15.7). This SDK never reads "},{"code":"subjectToken","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" to decide the value: which kind of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"token the caller holds is only the caller’s to know, AXIAM refuses refresh and ID"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"token types by name, and a refusal is never retried as a different type."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"subjectTokenType"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"its presence selects delegation; its absence selects impersonation.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Two different operations with different risk, and §15.2 rule 1 forbids papering over"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the difference: this SDK supplies no default actor token and never substitutes its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own session for one. Passing nothing here asks for impersonation, and the server"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"refuses unless this client holds that grant."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The actor token must have been issued to this client"}]},{"text":" (§15.2 rule 9, contract","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"1.60): obtain it with the same client’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamClient\/loginClientCredentials(scope:tenantID:configuration:)"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"grant and pass its ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/OidcTokenSet\/accessToken"},{"text":" here — its ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"sub"},{"text":" is this client’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"client_id"},{"text":". A token issued to another client, a console sign-in or a service","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"account is answered ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"400"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"invalid_request"},{"text":" (“actor_token was not issued to the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exchanging client”), which surfaces unchanged: not retried, not rewritten into an","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"impersonation, and not repaired by substituting a token of this SDK’s own.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"actorToken"},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"omit to inherit the subject’s, bounded by this client’s registration. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"response’s "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ExchangedToken\/scope"},{"type":"text","text":" is what was actually granted, which may be"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"narrower than what was asked for even on success (§15.2 rule 7) — read it."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"scopes"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"What this deliberately does ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"not","type":"text"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" do:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"No retry, downgrade or rewrite on ","type":"text"},{"code":"unauthorized_client","type":"codeVoice"}]},{"text":" (§15.2 rule 2). It means","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"either “this client may not exchange at all” or “this client may not impersonate”;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"both are registration facts an operator must fix, and reworking the request into a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"delegation would send one the caller did not write.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"No auto-narrowing on ","type":"text"},{"code":"invalid_scope","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (§15.2 rule 3). The server refuses rather than"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"silently narrowing precisely so the caller finds out here."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No refresh token, ever"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (§15.2 rule 4). ","type":"text"},{"code":"TokenExchangeResponse","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" has no such field,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/ExchangedToken","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" has nowhere to put one, and this result never enters the §9","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"single-flight refresh guard. Re-run the exchange to get a fresh token.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No adoption"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" (§15.2 rule 5). The exchanged token is not this client’s session — not"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"even behind an opt-in flag, which is a MUST NOT here where adoption elsewhere is a MAY."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It is a token to hand onward in one outbound call; adopting it would silently"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-privilege every subsequent call this client makes."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A cross-tenant subject token answers ","type":"text"},{"code":"invalid_grant","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", and this SDK does not try to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"distinguish “wrong tenant” from “bad token” (§15.3): the server collapses them because","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"telling them apart is a tenant-enumeration signal.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamclient\/tokenexchange(subjecttoken:subjecttokentype:actortoken:scopes:audience:resource:tenantid:configuration:)"]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","extendedModule":"AxiamSDK","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"tokenExchange"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subjectToken"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sensitive","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":">, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"subjectTokenType"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"actorToken"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Sensitive","preciseIdentifier":"s:8AxiamSDK9SensitiveV"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"kind":"text","text":">?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"scopes"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"]?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"audience"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"resource"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"tenantID"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SS","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String"},{"kind":"text"